// The Go apps that use external dependencies.
//
// `go_deps` accepts only one `from_file`, so it reads the apps' `go.mod` files through this file.
// Each app has to be a Bazel package, so that `go_deps` can name its `go.mod` with a label.
//
// The file isn't named `go.work`, because the go command would then use it for every module in the
// repository.
go 1.25

use (
	./mirrord/layer-tests/apps/app-go
	./mirrord/layer-tests/apps/issue834
)
